{"benchmark": "ifeval", "task_id": "1001", "sample_idx": 31, "model_name": "google/gemma-3n-e2b-it", "content": "Hark gentle traveler to the land of the Rising Sun! A journey most grand awaits thee.\n\n**Day One: Arrival in Tokyo a City of Lights**\n\nUpon arrival in Tokyo a city bright\nThy weary bones shall find a welcome sight.\nTo Shinjuku's heights ascend with haste\nAnd view the city's splendor a wondrous taste.\nDine on ramen savory and bold\nA tale of flavors to be told.\n\n**Day Two: Culture and Tradition Unfurled**\n\nTo Asakusa's temple journey forth\nWhere ancient rituals display their worth.\nExplore the Senso-ji a sacred place\nAnd feel the spirits in this hallowed space.\nThen wander through Ueno Park so green\nWhere art and nature are a joyful scene.\n\n**Day Three: Modern Marvels and Pop Culture's Gleam**\n\nTo Shibuya's crossing brave thy way\nA human river in a vibrant sway.\nExplore Harajuku's fashion's art\nA spectacle that doth steal the heart.\nThen venture forth to Akihabara's land\nWhere electronics reign a wondrous strand.\n\n**Day Four: Hakone's Beauty a Mountain's Grace**\n\nA journey forth to Hakone's shore\nWhere mountains rise forevermore.\nCruise Lake Ashi a tranquil sight\nAnd witness Mount Fuji bathed in light.\nRide the ropeway a thrilling ride\nWith vistas grand on every side.\n\n**Day Five: Kyoto's Ancient Capital a Royal Dream**\n\nTo Kyoto's gates thy spirit flies\nA city steeped in history's guise.\nVisit Fushimi Inari's vermilion gates\nA pathway winding where magic waits.\nExplore Kiyomizu-dera's wooden stage\nA panoramic view for every age.\n\n**Day Six: Golden Pavilion and Zen's Stillness**\n\nTo Kinkaku-ji a golden gleam\nA temple mirrored in a tranquil stream.\nFind solace in Ryoan-ji's stone\nA garden's mystery uniquely shown.\nThen wander Gion's geisha's lane\nA glimpse of beauty easing pain.\n\n**Day Seven: Nara's Deer and Todai-ji's Might**\n\nTo Nara's lands a pilgrimage we make\nWhere friendly deer their freedom take.\nVisit Todai-ji a temple grand\nWith Buddha's statue a sight so planned.\nExplore Kasuga Taisha's lanterns bright\nA pathway bathed in ethereal light.\n\n**Day Eight: Departure a Farewell to Sun and Sky**\n\nThy journey nears its destined end\nA parting gift a faithful friend.\nFrom Kansai Airport fare thee well\nA memory to cherish and to tell.\nGo forth with joy and spirits free\nAnd carry Japan's magic with thee.\n\n\n\n", "logprobs": [{"token": "H", "logprob": -0.0029929152224212885}, {"token": "ark", "logprob": -1.3351351299206726e-05}, {"token": "▁gentle", "logprob": -0.516659677028656}, {"token": "▁traveler", "logprob": -0.009209651499986649}, {"token": "▁to", "logprob": -0.13360361754894257}, {"token": "▁the", "logprob": -1.1346303224563599}, {"token": "▁land", "logprob": -0.38853782415390015}, {"token": "▁of", "logprob": -0.00017498392844572663}, {"token": "▁the", "logprob": -0.01636253483593464}, {"token": "▁Rising", "logprob": -2.1269402503967285}, {"token": "▁Sun", "logprob": -2.3841855067985307e-07}, {"token": "!", "logprob": -0.2744007706642151}, {"token": "▁A", "logprob": -0.1648159623146057}, {"token": "▁journey", "logprob": -0.08057453483343124}, {"token": "▁most", "logprob": -0.38707154989242554}, {"token": "▁grand", "logprob": -0.2330525666475296}, {"token": "▁awaits", "logprob": -0.06369376927614212}, {"token": "▁thee", "logprob": -0.021183546632528305}, {"token": ".", "logprob": -0.530431866645813}, {"token": "\n\n", "logprob": -0.12854886054992676}, {"token": "**", "logprob": -0.0019733496010303497}, {"token": "Day", "logprob": -0.2945396602153778}, {"token": "▁One", "logprob": -0.9345852136611938}, {"token": ":", "logprob": -0.08291932195425034}, {"token": "▁Arrival", "logprob": -0.008757635951042175}, {"token": "▁in", "logprob": -0.00012611546844709665}, {"token": "▁Tokyo", "logprob": -0.24625320732593536}, {"token": "▁a", "logprob": -0.22776390612125397}, {"token": "▁City", "logprob": -0.005031779408454895}, {"token": "▁of", "logprob": -